### Test Notifications API Endpoints
### Make sure to replace the Bearer token and notification IDs with real values

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@notificationId = 64e7b5a2c9d4e8f3a1b2c3d4
@userId = 64e7b5a2c9d4e8f3a1b2c3d5

### ==================== USER ENDPOINTS ====================

### 1. Get User Notifications (with pagination and filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=1&limit=10&is_read=false&type=booking
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get User Notifications (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get User Notifications (with sorting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?sort=-created_at,type
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Unread Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Specific Notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Mark Notification as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Mark All Notifications as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Update Notification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_read": true
}

### 9. Soft Delete Notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Clear All Notifications (Soft Delete All)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==================== ADMIN ENDPOINTS ====================

### 11. Admin - Get All Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/admin/all?page=1&limit=20&isDeleted=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Admin - Get All Notifications with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/admin/all?user_id={{userId}}&type=payment&status=sent
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Admin - Get Specific Notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/admin/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==================== INTERNAL SERVICE ENDPOINTS ====================

### 14. Internal - Send Single Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/internal/send
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "recipient_type": "guest",
  "title": "Booking Confirmation",
  "message": "Your booking has been confirmed. Check your booking details for more information.",
  "type": "booking",
  "sent_method": ["email", "in_app"]
}

### 15. Internal - Send Bulk Notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/internal/bulk-send
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "recipient_type": "guest",
    "title": "Payment Received",
    "message": "We have received your payment. Thank you for your booking!",
    "type": "payment",
    "sent_method": ["email", "in_app"]
  },
  {
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "recipient_type": "guest",
    "title": "Verification Required",
    "message": "Please verify your identity to complete your booking.",
    "type": "verification",
    "sent_method": ["in_app"]
  }
]

