### ==================== FILTER TESTS ====================

### 20. Filter by Type - Booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?type=booking
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 21. Filter by Status - Sent
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?status=sent
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 22. Filter by Read Status - Unread
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?is_read=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 23. Combined Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?type=payment&is_read=false&status=sent&sort=-created_at
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==================== NOTES ====================
### Available notification types: booking, payment, verification, refund, message, system, reminder
### Available recipient types: guest, host, admin
### Available sent methods: email, in_app, sms, push
### Available statuses: pending, sent, failed
### Available sort fields: created_at, updated_at, type, status (prefix with - for descending) 